  "scope": "Desktop-only source-viewer UX; no analytical, source-verification, financial or exporter changes.",
  "implementation": [
    "Compact company/filename/read-only header; native accessible dialog title visually hidden, native X/Escape/outside dismissal preserved; Download Original is the only bottom action.",
    "Formula/name box \u2192 bounded grid \u2192 horizontal scrollbar \u2192 actual bottom worksheet tabs, with vertical scrollbar immediately right of grid.",
    "Pointer-drag/track-click virtual scrollbars change viewport independently of cell selection and clamp to original used bounds. Accessible scrollbar keyboard controls remain scoped to the scrollbar.",
    "Grid clicks/arrows/name-box navigation reveal selection; original formula/raw value and optional provenance stay synchronized locally.",
    "No wheel handlers: wheel events cannot change worksheet position and continue scrolling the native dialog.",
    "Tabs switch among actual approved workbook sheets without a Python rerun; source citation identity is separate and restored when returning to its sheet.",
    "Client viewport measurement prevents workbook component mounting until desktop width \u22651024px is confirmed. Preview/View in Source are absent on phones; a guarded ?page=source route reports desktop-only access.",
    "Existing strict three-company source allowlist, byte hash verification, downloads and derived-operand navigation reused unchanged."
